# The canonical tree is byte-compared against every enrolled repo, so anything
# that lands here uninvited becomes a diff in 48 repos. A macOS .DS_Store did
# exactly that during seeding — ignored at the source, invisible to `cp -R`,
# and staged by a fresh clone that had no ignore rules yet.
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
node_modules/
